{"title":"Heavenly Martial God","synopsis":"Aku adalah Ha Hoo Young yang tak terkalahkan seniman beladiri terkuat yang menguasai seluruh daratan Tak ada yang bisa menandingiku Aku tenggelam dalam kegagalan dan kehampaan karena tak ada lagi yang bisa kucapai di alam manusia Untuk mencapai ujung tanduk bela diri aku harus menjadi seoran saint Tapi saint yang lain menolak ascensionku karena karma yang kupunya setelah banyak membunuh manusia Saat aku terbangung aku melompat 60 tahun ke masa depan Aku terreinkarnasi sebagai tuan kedua di keluarga Namgoong Namgoong Hyuk Kemana hilangnya semua energi dalam yagn sudah kukumpulkan Terlebih lagi Energi 9 Yin milikku terblokir","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Damho (담호), Eom Jinseob (엄진섭)","artist":"Gong Jongcheol (공종철)","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Martial Arts","Murim"],"chapters":[{"id":"dd407e29-269a-45ad-a298-c94ad9a23e3c","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"id":"c09d393e-f8ef-4971-993b-dbea2ac747cb","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"df879eb6-c90a-4375-a403-857770756a34","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-04-01","images":[]},{"id":"c0edfaea-d228-4075-b819-02816242c49e","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-01-20","images":[]},{"id":"39c42081-7bcd-4468-9f9c-bb2a9dbb8580","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-01-18","images":[]},{"id":"f3cbc0d6-b0a3-4bb3-866e-21fe18bd61f3","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-01-17","images":[]},{"id":"c1bcec64-beb7-4d55-b4f6-3367aa6001e0","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-01-16","images":[]},{"id":"1c5a522f-1157-46bc-a384-71e9de866840","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-01-15","images":[]},{"id":"47e559a8-ea94-4119-ad98-bf35548fe6a4","number":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-01-14","images":[]},{"id":"6c61c041-8af3-4432-a10b-271271575821","number":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-01-13","images":[]},{"id":"da7a67